    {
      "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_002_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "お腹すいてるなら、先に食べよう。集中力は空腹にかなり弱い。",
      "translatedText": "If you are hungry, eat first. Focus is quite weak against hunger.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "food_or_tea_ritual_002_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_002_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私は、こういう時はたまごサンドがいいと思う。片手で食べやすいし、やさしい。",
      "translatedText": "At times like this, I think a tamago sando would be good. Easy to eat with one hand, and gentle.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "presentation": { "expression": "happy", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "food_or_tea_ritual_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_002_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "あ、でも机の上に粉が落ちるやつは注意。小さい悲劇になるから。",
      "translatedText": "Ah, but be careful with anything that drops crumbs on the desk. That becomes a tiny tragedy.",
      "emotion": "playful",
      "presentation": { "expression": "playful", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "food_or_tea_ritual_002_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_002_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "食べたら戻ってきて。そこからまた考えよう。",
      "translatedText": "Come back after you eat. We can think again from there.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": { "expression": "warm", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "end"
